WEBVTT

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:11.910
Runway models.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:17.290
They're the models who shine
at fashion shows.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.250
I'm Chiyuki Fujito.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:29.830
This is my story
of becoming a top model.

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:31.000
And...

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.700
"Mille Neige Modeling Agency"
"8 Years Ago"

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.160
"Mille Neige Modeling Agency"
"8 Years Ago"
What? Another growth spurt, Chiyuki?

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.120
Yup! Now I'm 158 cm!

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:46.540
"Chiyuki Fujito
10 years old"
That's tall for a fourth grader!

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:47.910
Hey, Shizuku.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:50.830
To walk at Paris Fashion Week,
how tall would I need to be?

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:54.040
Well, I'd say you'd need to be
at least 175 cm.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:56.450
175 cm!

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:59.080
Since I'm 158 cm now...

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:02.120
I need 20 cm more, right Shizuku?

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:05.660
Shizuku's the first model
from Mille Neige,

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.830
my dad's modeling agency,

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.290
to walk the runway in Paris Fashion Week.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:13.660
I hold an intense adoration
for this celebration of fashion

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:16.830
where participation is exclusive
to top models.

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:21.200
I wanna be in Paris Fashion Week, too!

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:24.370
Grow at least 20 cm more, okay?

00:01:24.370 --> 00:01:26.330
The President must be so proud.

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:30.250
His own daughter has what it takes
to represent his company.

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:33.450
At this rate,
she'll grow to be 180 cm.

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:37.000
It all comes down to height
when you're a runway model.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:37.950
Chiyuki.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:38.830
Dad!

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:42.370
Hey, I got a job for you.

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:43.410
Paris Fashion Week?!

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:44.250
Of course not.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:45.750
What?

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.870
Well it's gonna happen soon, okay?!

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:48.700
I know it!

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:51.080
Yeah, it will.

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:52.750
But it turns out...

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:56.370
I never grew
another centimeter after that.

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:58.370
"Height"
"Greatest Model"

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.330
Shizuku!
Could I be in Paris Fashion Week?

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:07.040
Dad! I want to be in Paris Fashion Week!

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.660
Chiyuki, I'm going to be direct.

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:14.750
With that height,
you can't go to Paris.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.830
And if you keep this up...

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:19.040
Who said it was impossible?!

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:22.200
I'll fire you.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.700
Two years ago,

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:29.910
I was fired by my dad.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.120
"Episode 1 This Is Your Story"

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:34.790
"Episode 1 This Is Your Story"
Come on, Chiyuki.

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:37.620
"Mille Neige Audition"
Remember what I told you
at the last audition?

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:41.040
And the one before that
and the one before that?

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:43.750
"Paris Fashion Week, here we come!"

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.080
I said, "Don't come back."

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:49.910
You've got a lot of nerve
to show up like this.

00:02:49.910 --> 00:02:54.830
Oh, yeah? You're only here because you want
to retire early with a stable income.

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:56.000
What?!

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.410
You're fired! Now get out!

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.790
It's okay, Shizuku.

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.620
So, Chiyuki.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:07.080
What's with that outfit?

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:11.290
It's the outfit you wore
at Paris Fashion Week.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.620
I'll pass if this looks good on me, right?

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:16.000
Are you kidding me with those heels?

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:21.750
There's nothing more hideous
than wearing heels to cheat your height.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:25.290
There are plenty of models out there
who look good in clothes.

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:29.330
Runway models don't showcase themselves.
They showcase the clothes.

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:31.040
That's why you need that height.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:34.040
Those proportions.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:37.500
We're not a big agency
that can pull strings.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:44.950
I'm afraid there's no hope for you.
You just don't have the height.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:47.910
Chiyuki, it's impossible.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.290
Please just give up.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.410
"Dressing Room"

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.000
Chiyuki.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.200
Thought you might be interested.

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:04.370
I gathered audition paperwork
for other agencies.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:07.160
You've got the looks. I bet you'll--

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:08.750
Takahashi.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.450
Don't worry about me.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:14.500
I'll be back! Tell Shizuku for me.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:19.700
My dream isn't just to appear
in Paris Fashion Week.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:22.160
I'm not giving up.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.580
If you haven't submitted
your post-graduation plans yet,

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.290
make sure you give it to Fujito,
today's teacher's assistant.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:37.120
Fujito, collect them
and get them to me after class, okay?

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:38.540
Will do!

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:44.290
"Post-Graduation Plans
Chiyuki Fujito
First Choice: Supermodel"

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:45.450
"Post-Graduation Plans
Chiyuki Fujito
First Choice: Supermodel"
Whoa!

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:48.120
You've got a glamorous future ahead!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.540
You'll make your father proud!

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:54.080
Chiyuki, eventually you could take over
as president!

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:56.040
No thank you!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.500
Why not?

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:00.620
Well, you're already a model,
aren't you?

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:03.080
Oh, you're right.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.580
"Post-Graduation Plans
Chiyuki Fujito
First Choice: Hypermodel"

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:06.580
I'm gonna be a hypermodel!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:07.540
Wow!

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.080
Miss Fujito.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:09.910
Yes?

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:13.580
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to interrupt.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:17.450
The post-graduation plans
I just submitted...

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:20.080
Oh... What was your name...?

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:25.620
Chiyuki, he's your classmate.
So... What was your name again?

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:26.620
Hey.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:29.450
It's Tsumura... Ikuto Tsumura.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:31.540
Oh, you're the bean sprouts guy!

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:32.830
Bean sprouts?

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:35.290
Remember? Everyone teased him
for bringing

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:38.580
plain bean sprouts with rice
for lunch on sports day?

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:41.000
Ah, how does everyone know about that?!

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.870
Oh... Are you poor or something?

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.500
Chiyuki, rude much?

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:45.540
So, what's up?

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:48.000
Right, about that...

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:51.080
I wanted to rewrite my plan,
if that's okay.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.160
I-I'll bring it right back!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.830
Sure. Sounds good.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.870
Okay, great.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:00.290
Thanks so much!

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:05.580
Could we stop by the library?

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:06.750
Sure thing!

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:11.540
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:16.870
He said he'd be right back!

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:19.000
Hey, about that Tsumura guy...

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.950
Tsumura? Who's that?

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:22.200
Remember this morning?

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:24.250
That unfortunate guy
with the bob?

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.870
Oh, right.

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:27.620
Any idea where he could be?

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:30.580
Hmm... Probably...

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:31.540
Oh, yeah!

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.080
"Dressmaking Room"

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:35.910
Is this it?

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.950
Never knew we had a handicraft club.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:39.750
Excuse me.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.870
Whoa! M-Miss Fujito?!

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:43.000
Your post-grad plans?

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.910
Ah... S-Sorry!

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:49.080
He didn't even change anything.

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:52.660
So sorry! Please forgive me. I'm very sorry.

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:55.410
Hey! That's the Paris Fashion Week DVD!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:57.120
Why do you have this?

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:00.080
Why...? My advisor lent it to me...

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.870
And it's the one Shizuku's featured in!

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:05.750
She's so beautiful...

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.950
Tsumura, what were you doing watching this?

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:11.750
Oh... I'm trying to recreate the same outfit
by watching it.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:18.500
How so?

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.410
I'm working with what we have here!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.080
There's no money to buy fabric

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:25.200
so I'm just recycling
old clothes that were donated.

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:29.120
Hey, he's pretty interesting.

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:35.870
Hey, Tsumura.

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.120
Yes...?

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:39.500
Do you think I'll look good
in this outfit?

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:44.950
What? Y-You're a model, Miss Fujito.
You'll look good in anything.

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:46.040
I know, right?

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.160
Vain, much?

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:49.290
Do you have anything better for me?

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:52.120
For you? Well...

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:55.080
L-Let me go check in the closet!

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:00.950
Whoa... Did you really make all of these?

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:04.580
Yes, I did. Since I'm the only club member...

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:10.910
Miss Fujito,
what do you think of this one?

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:13.200
Are you trying to piss me off?

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:16.910
Hey! Explain to me why you chose this one.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:21.660
I-I'm sorry. It's just that you always
speak your mind

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:24.290
and you're way more manly than I--

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.660
Hey, why don't you finish that thought?

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:29.830
But let's see...

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:32.580
For you, Miss Fujito,
we want to find the right balance

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:35.450
with your masculine spirit
and feminine appearance...

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:38.700
That means we cut the sleeves,
lengthen it...

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:42.830
Did he really just call me masculine?

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.450
But taking a closer look...

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:48.870
You can tell he took it apart
and sewed it back together many times.

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:52.950
He didn't have enough fabric here.

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:55.750
Making clothes must be his passion.

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:58.160
You should be one.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.450
What?

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:01.250
A fashion designer.

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:06.540
Oh, there's no way I could do that.

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:09.080
That's not what I want to do anyway.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.830
Really? You sure about that?

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:15.540
I saw that you wrote
"Tokyo Designer Fashion School"...

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:17.410
But you erased it.

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:23.080
Miss Fujito...

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:27.120
Do you think I could be a fashion designer
with only a high school diploma?

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:29.250
See? You do.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:32.660
But I don't think that's possible.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:36.870
All the designers I know
went to college for it.

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:39.410
Even my dad's company
only accepts new grads

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:42.290
from professional school or college.

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:46.290
So, yeah, the designer industry
is surprisingly tough.

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:49.580
Right... I knew that...

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:53.580
I'm assuming you have financial reasons
that are preventing you to go, right?

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:56.120
Why don't you look into getting a scholarship?

00:09:56.120 --> 00:10:01.330
I have three younger sisters.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:04.790
One's super smart.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.660
One's a talented volleyball player.

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:12.080
The youngest is so far apart in age,
she's just too darn cute.

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:18.080
But one refuses to go even though
she could get into any college she wants.

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:21.120
The other one rejected an offer
from a top-ranking school

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:23.200
because it would be too expensive.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:26.370
As for the youngest,
she's only five years old.

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:29.500
I want her to dream big.

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:31.500
All of this.

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:37.250
All of this will resolve
once I get a job this year.

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.290
So...

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:41.660
That's why I'm not going to college.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.450
I just don't want to.

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.750
Ah, I see.

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:48.290
Tsumura's in the same boat as me.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.370
We both have circumstances

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:54.410
that prevent us
from fulfilling our dreams.

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:57.410
But that's not a reason to quit...

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:05.290
What?

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:06.870
It's impossible.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.330
You can't go to Paris.

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:13.370
But I don't think that's possible.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:19.290
What did I say...?

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:23.450
No... Not possible...? Who said that?

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.410
Tsumura... Or did I...?

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:28.620
Miss Fujito.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:35.040
Thanks to what you said earlier,
I feel more determined now.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:41.370
Huh...? Miss Fujito?

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:42.700
What...?

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:55.410
How could I, of all people,
say that something's impossible?

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:56.540
"Mille Neige
Audition"

00:11:56.540 --> 00:12:00.120
"Mille Neige
Audition"
Chiyuki, it's time to give up now.

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:06.370
Failed... again.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:09.620
"ModelT.T Fashion
Fashion Model/Talent Application Form"

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:17.000
You're accepted.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.950
You'll be working with us
starting tomorrow.

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:22.160
R-Really...?

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:26.700
Yes. Here's the contract.
Fill it out and bring it to us next time.

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:29.120
I knew it. It is possible.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:31.950
I've got the potential.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:37.580
I passed an audition
for a major agency, just like that!

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:39.950
If that's not potential,
I don't know what is!

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:40.790
I've got this.

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:43.410
Fujito, we need to talk.

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:45.120
I need an explanation.

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:48.750
What do you mean
by supermodel and hypermodel...?

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:52.000
A supermodel is a model
who appears in Paris Fashion Week.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.910
That's not exactly common sense, you know?

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:56.620
What about a hypermodel?

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.370
A hypermodel...

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:11.950
A hypermodel is a model from Mille Neige,
my dad's agency, who goes

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:15.500
and gets featured in Paris.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:19.450
--The Mille Neige model who goes to Paris...
The Mille Neige model who goes to Paris...
--What... What...?

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:23.250
I'm going to be
the Mille Neige model who goes to Paris!

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.870
Nothing's going to stop me now!

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:26.910
I'm going to do everything I can!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.000
Thanks so much!

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:31.120
I made up my mind!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.120
What...?

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:39.750
Runway models don't showcase themselves.
They showcase the clothes.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.950
That's why you need that height.
Those proportions.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:46.660
I just have to wear the outfit
and look amazing, that's all.

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:47.660
Tsumura!

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:49.870
Huh? M-Miss Fujito?

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:50.750
What's the matter?

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:51.620
Hey!

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:54.370
I'll give you all my clothes I don't wear!

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:57.370
Just make me look amazing!

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:58.830
What...?

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:04.500
Smile down the runway.

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:06.830
"Hayasaka General Hospital"

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:09.660
Wow, you're making clothes for a model?

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:12.790
Yup. We're in the same class...

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:17.500
Oh? Don't tell me.
Ikuto, is she your girlfriend?

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.200
S-She's not!

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.660
Then why are you so embarrassed?

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:26.700
It's not like that at all.
We've never really talked until today.

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:28.950
Well.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:33.500
Your clothes have the magic
that can make anyone happy, Ikuto.

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:36.830
This one's going to turn out wonderful, too.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.000
Thanks.

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:44.620
I'm back!

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:49.290
Hey, Iku's back! We missed you!

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:53.160
Hey. Why did you make me a skirt?
I told you I need something

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:54.750
that's easy to move around in!

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:58.620
Check again, that's actually a skort.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.790
--Be nice!
--Oh... But that's not the point!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.790
Ouch! Cut it out, Aoi.

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:07.580
Be nice! Ao, if you don't want it,
Ichika will take it!

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:11.620
Hey Ikuto. Did you already submit
your post-graduation plans?

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:13.120
Oh. Yeah, I did...

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:15.250
Ao, give it to Ichika!

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:17.080
It's too big on you, Ichika.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.700
Give it to me!

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:21.750
So, what did you write?

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:24.330
"F-Find employment."

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:28.410
Hey Ikuto...

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:31.500
You don't have to do that
if you don't want to.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.950
It's not like that, Honoka.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:39.500
That's what I want to do. To find a job.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.950
But... You have a passion...
You're holding back...

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:49.080
You don't have to do everything like Mom.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:52.160
Iku!

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:58.700
Ao, Noka, Ichika and Mom...
We're all your customers, Iku!

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:02.750
That means you're our favorite dressmaker!

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:09.000
You're always gonna be
our favorite dressmaker!

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:12.080
That's right. And also...

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.750
I could do what I want
and still be working.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:17.660
Like that time at my part-time job...

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.620
The newspaper distributor?

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:25.290
Yup. I made the owner's son a suit
for his entrance ceremony.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:28.120
They were so happy with it.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:29.040
"Entrance Ceremony"

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:33.580
"Entrance Ceremony"
My clothes make people happy,
what more could I ask for?

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:35.950
But...

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:38.950
That's not the point.

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:42.700
Thanks, Honoka.
But I'm happy with my decision.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:48.080
"Audition List"

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:49.950
Thank you very much.

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:55.080
Think Chiyuki will show up today?

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:56.950
Who knows.

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:59.040
I always wondered...

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:01.540
Why haven't we banned her yet?

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:04.830
The President told her
to do what she wants.

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:09.540
She's the type who won't give up
unless she wants to.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:16.120
So it's our job to keep on telling her
that she has no talent.

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:18.000
That's a tough role.

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:21.620
It's nothing compared
to what Chiyuki's going through.

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:24.370
S-She's here...

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:27.750
Must be Chiyuki. Sure, let her in.

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:31.870
There's nothing more painful
than pursuing a hopeless dream.

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:33.870
Chiyuki, that's why...

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:37.290
I'm going to tell you repeatedly...

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:39.000
That you don't have...

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.330
...what it takes...

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:11.120
What is... that look?

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:13.500
Oh, no. It's weird, isn't it?

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.250
No, I mean...

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:20.910
Shizuku, I'm not going to give up.

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:27.160
My dad started a modeling agency...

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:30.040
Seeing Shizuku walk at Paris Fashion Week...

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:35.120
I've dedicated my whole life
to following this dream.

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:37.620
That's why...

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:41.250
If I give up now, I won't be myself!

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:50.040
You're going to pursue a hopeless dream
for the rest of your life...?

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:53.160
I'll make it a reality!
I've got the rest of my life!

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.700
You're being ridiculous.

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:02.040
A 158 cm Paris Fashion Week model...

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:03.450
There's no way.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:06.200
There's no way, but...

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.790
For a moment...

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:15.080
I saw a glimpse of Paris...

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:21.250
One percent...

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:24.120
I just saw a one percent chance.

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:34.620
Come to the back later.
I'll explain our contract.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:44.540
Mille Neige is as old as you, Chiyuki.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:47.910
It was established the year you were born.

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:51.910
I always wanted a French name
for my company

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:56.410
and I named it
after the most precious thing in my life.

00:19:56.410 --> 00:19:58.540
"Mille" and "neige."

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:02.830
Chiyuki... It's your name.

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:05.660
"Thousand Snow"

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:07.950
That's right.

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:12.080
My dream isn't just to appear
in Paris Fashion Week.

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:17.580
I want to be there to represent
my dad's company, Mille Neige.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.790
All right, we're all set.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:25.910
I'm sure you know, but you're only allowed

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:29.450
to accept work approved through us
from here on out.

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:31.040
That's strictly enforced.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.040
Yikes!

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.370
What?

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:38.200
It happened before this,
so it doesn't count!

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:40.200
What did you do?

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.080
A street snap...

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:45.790
Ah, where fashion magazines
feature amateurs...

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:49.790
Handle yourself like a professional.
Don't bother with that anymore.

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:53.370
It's been a while
since I felt that kind of attention...

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:55.250
Where did it happen?

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:58.950
Downstairs by the agency,
right in front of Dad's store.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:02.450
I wanted to find something
that went with my outfit.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:07.330
What do you mean?
Didn't you buy everything at Mille Neige?

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:10.160
What?! O-Oh, yeah. You're right.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:14.750
I can't say that this outfit
was made by an amateur!

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:19.790
Your outfit is so cute!
Where is it from?

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:23.120
Huh? Oh... Um...

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:25.450
I'm going to be a hypermodel!

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:28.700
I can't say that it's handmade
by a friend...

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:33.410
At Mille Neige, right around the corner!

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:41.370
"The Spring look from
up-and-coming brand 'Mille Neige'"

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:47.330
Sara, you're up next.

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:51.790
"I love this style!"

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:53.910
"Sara
Model
3,913,965 followers"

00:21:57.620 --> 00:21:59.080
Oh, that's cute.

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:00.410
Don't you love this?

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:02.120
Love it.

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:03.830
Super cute!

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:05.790
Chiyuki looks great here.

00:22:05.790 --> 00:22:07.160
Hey, it's Chiyuki!

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:12.330
We're checking right now.

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:13.620
What is going on?

00:22:13.620 --> 00:22:17.620
It's this. There's a rush of customers
contacting us about it.

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:20.120
How should we handle this, President?

00:22:20.120 --> 00:22:21.660
Regarding that matter...

00:22:21.660 --> 00:22:23.830
Let me go talk to Chiyuki.

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:29.830
Yes! This is the Tsumura Dress Shop!

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:31.660
Cut that out, Ichika!

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:35.870
Who's Fujito? Is she your girlfriend, Iku?

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:36.830
What?

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:41.700
I'm sorry for the sudden call, Tsumura.

00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:44.660
I'm Kenji Fujito,
company president of Mille Neige.

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:45.580
It's a pleasure.

00:22:45.580 --> 00:22:49.580
Y-Yes! Um... How can I help...?

00:22:49.580 --> 00:22:52.200
I'm sure you heard
the gist of it from Chiyuki.

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:53.950
So, I'll get right to the point.

00:22:53.950 --> 00:22:57.500
I want you to sell me
the design you made for Chiyuki.

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:58.790
What...?

00:22:58.790 --> 00:23:00.830
I apologize for how this turned out.

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:04.790
Our company got all the credit
and recognition for your creation.

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:07.540
N-No... It's nothing, really...

00:23:07.540 --> 00:23:12.620
I called you here to talk about
an official launch of that design.

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:15.080
O-Of course! As you wish.

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:16.160
Thanks.

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:17.870
I know.

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:20.250
And one more thing.

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:21.540
Y-Yes!

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:24.200
I'm just putting this out there, but...

00:23:24.200 --> 00:23:26.200
--We just lost a designer
and I need one for a project coming up.

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:27.950
--That gaze...
--We just lost a designer
and I need one for a project coming up.

00:23:27.950 --> 00:23:28.910
--We just lost a designer
and I need one for a project coming up.

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:32.200
It's the same gaze I felt
when I was young.

00:23:32.200 --> 00:23:35.040
So, what do you say?
Do you want to work for us as a designer?

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:40.870
As if he's gazing
at a rough diamond...

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:41.540
"Chiyuki Fujito"

00:23:41.540 --> 00:23:42.540
"Chiyuki Fujito"
That's right.

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:48.540
I'm Chiyuki Fujito. This is my story
of becoming a top model.

00:23:48.540 --> 00:23:50.540
And...

00:23:50.540 --> 00:23:54.120
"Ikuto Tsumura"
I'm Ikuto Tsumura.

00:23:54.750 --> 00:23:59.120
Designers are the true stars
of the fashion industry.

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:01.120
That goes for this project, too.

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:04.660
I understand this can be intimidating
since it's your first time.

00:24:04.660 --> 00:24:07.330
But you have the liberty
to create what you want.

00:24:07.330 --> 00:24:08.330
That said...

00:24:08.330 --> 00:24:15.000
The star of this project,
this story, is you, Ikuto Tsumura.

00:24:16.160 --> 00:24:19.790
And I'm Ikuto Tsumura.

00:24:19.790 --> 00:24:24.540
This is my story
of becoming a fashion designer.

00:24:24.540 --> 00:24:26.580
Clothes can transform a person.

00:24:26.580 --> 00:24:29.250
That's why I want to make them.

00:24:29.250 --> 00:24:31.540
I want to be a professional designer.

00:24:31.540 --> 00:24:33.950
Next episode, "The Professional World."

00:24:33.950 --> 00:24:36.910
"See you next time!!"
